1111+ 0AF5              ; Guest RAM backing access
1112+ 0AF5              ;
1113+ 0AF5              ; Guest RAM allocation starts at NeoGS physical page 44h.
1114+ 0AF5              ; Guest byte address maps linearly to physical offset 110000h + guest address.
1115+ 0AF5              ; WIN3 is a permanently reserved bank aperture; its current page is volatile.
1116+ 0AF5              ; These routines do not restore WIN3's previous page because the page port is
1117+ 0AF5              ; write-only and WIN3 is owned exclusively by this memory backend.
