 149+ 13B0              ; Receive one ATM -> NeoGS ABI 1.0 frame through ZX DMA.
 150+ 13B0              ; Entry: resident dispatcher consumed E0h from ZXCMD; CBIT remains asserted.
 151+ 13B0              ; Resident code, stack and interrupt handlers must stay in WIN0-WIN2.
 152+ 13B0              ; OUT: carry clear/A=0, HL=#C000 and BC=derived frame size; otherwise
 153+ 13B0              ; carry set/A=status. Production DMA destination is physical 108000h on
 154+ 13B0              ; page 42h, mapped into WIN3 through MPAGEX (#10) using Project125 selector encoding.
 155+ 13B0              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------
